Interpretation in Machine Learning & NLP:
0° (cos = 1)

The vectors are exactly the same.
In NLP: Two words with identical word embeddings.
In recommendation systems: Two users with the same preferences.
90° (cos = 0)

The vectors are independent or unrelated.
In NLP: Two words with no semantic relationship.
In clustering: Two items belong to different clusters.
180° (cos = -1)

The vectors are completely opposite.
In NLP: Words with opposite meanings (e.g., "good" and "bad" in some embeddings).
In recommendation systems: Two users with totally opposite preferences.
